cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pylmrob in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "pylmrob: Python port of robustbase::lmrob (MM regression for robust linear models)"
abstract: >-
  Python port of R's robustbase::lmrob, the MM-estimator for robust
  linear regression. Implements the full fast-S resampling + MM
  iteration + design-adaptive D-scale pipeline (Koller & Stahel 2014)
  and matches R's robustbase 0.99-7 element-wise on the classical
  validation datasets. Ships Cython-accelerated kernels for all six
  psi families and an opt-in monolithic Cython engine that runs at
  about 1.2-1.7x R wall-clock.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Pablo
    family-names: Vena
    alias: anevolbap
repository-code: "https://github.com/anevolbap/pyrobustlm"
